{"title":"Knapping","sourceTitle":"Knapping/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Knapping/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Klopfen (2% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Knapping (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/tr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Yontma (Knapping) (88% translated)\" lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">Türkçe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Talla Lítica (88% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Taille de la pierre (88% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Scheggiatura (4% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/pl\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Łupanie (61% translated)\" lang=\"pl\" dir=\"ltr\">polski</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/sk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Štiepanie (35% translated)\" lang=\"sk\" dir=\"ltr\">slovenčina</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/cs\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Štípání kamene (90% translated)\" lang=\"cs\" dir=\"ltr\">čeština</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/bg\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Люспиране (6% translated)\" lang=\"bg\" dir=\"ltr\">български</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Откалывание (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Оббивка (100% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/th\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"การกะเทาะหิน (35% translated)\" lang=\"th\" dir=\"ltr\">ไทย</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"打制石器 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Knapping/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"ナッピング（石器作成） (53% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div><p><br />\n</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:PlayerKnapping.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/52/PlayerKnapping.png/200px-PlayerKnapping.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"356\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/52/PlayerKnapping.png/300px-PlayerKnapping.png 1.5x, /images/5/52/PlayerKnapping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"343\" data-file-height=\"610\" /></a><figcaption>Esmagamento Serafim</figcaption></figure>\n<p>É hora de fazer suas primeiras ferramentas! <b>Knapping</b> é um dos primeiros tipos de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/crafting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/crafting\">fabricação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\"> </a></span> disponíveis para o jogador, o que lhes permite fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/tools\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/tools\">ferramentas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tools\" title=\"Tools\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/weapons\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/weapons\">armas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\"> </a></span> primitivos de pedra.\n</p><p><span id=\"Acquiring&#95;Stones\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Adquirindo_Pedras\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Adquirindo Pedras</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Pedras_quebráveis\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pedras quebráveis</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Moldando_Pedras\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Moldando Pedras</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Finalizando_a_ferramenta\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Finalizando a ferramenta</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Tutoriais_em_vídeo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tutoriais em vídeo</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adquirindo_Pedras\">Adquirindo Pedras</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/stones\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/stones\">pedras</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Stones\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stones\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/flint\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/flint\">sílex</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Flint\" title=\"Flint\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/obsidian\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/obsidian\">obsidiana</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Obsidian\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obsidian\"> </a></span> soltos podem ser encontrados no solo quando <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/foraging\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/foraging\">coleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Foraging\" title=\"Foraging\"> </a></span>. Você pode coletá-los usando <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.<br />\nPor ordem de resistência da ferramenta resultante, as melhores pedras para lapidação são: <b>Obsidian&gt; Flint&gt; Todos os outros tipos de pedra.</b>\n</p><p><span id=\"Knappable&#95;stones\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Pedras_quebr.C3.A1veis\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pedras_quebráveis\">Pedras quebráveis</span></h2>\n<p>Apenas certos materiais podem ser usados ​​para fabricar cabeças de ferramentas e armas:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Imagem\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Material\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:LooseStones.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/2f/LooseStones.png/100px-LooseStones.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2f/LooseStones.png/150px-LooseStones.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2f/LooseStones.png/200px-LooseStones.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"407\" data-file-height=\"406\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">Pedra\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">O material mais comum, embora apenas alguns tipos de pedras possam ser utilizados: granito, andesito, sílex, basalto e peridotito. Outros tipos de pedra podem ser muito macios para serem quebrados, como; giz, conglomerado, calcário, argilito, arenito, xisto, filito, ardósia, kimberlito, escória, tufo, bauxita, sal-gema, suevita e mármore.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:LooseFlint.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/4b/LooseFlint.png/100px-LooseFlint.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4b/LooseFlint.png/150px-LooseFlint.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/4b/LooseFlint.png/200px-LooseFlint.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"401\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">Sílex\n</th>\n<td style=\"background-color: #E0CFBB; border-color: transparent;\">Um pouco menos comum. Encontrada comumente ao lado de outras pedras soltas ou sozinhas. Material um pouco melhor para fazer pontas de ferramentas e, ao contrário das pedras, pode ser usado para fazer pontas de flechas.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:LooseObsidian.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/LooseObsidian.png/100px-LooseObsidian.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/LooseObsidian.png/150px-LooseObsidian.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6e/LooseObsidian.png/200px-LooseObsidian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"326\" data-file-height=\"327\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">Obsidiana\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">Mais comumente encontrado em áreas onde a camada superior da rocha é o basalto. É o melhor material não metálico para ferramentas.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></dd></dl>\n<p><span id=\"Shaping&#95;Stones\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Moldando_Pedras\">Moldando Pedras</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:KnapSurface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/KnapSurface.png/250px-KnapSurface.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"249\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/e/e0/KnapSurface.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"317\" data-file-height=\"316\" /></a><figcaption>Superfície de desbaste.</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Para começar a lapidar, você precisa de pelo menos 2 pedras: pelo menos 1 das pedras quebráveis ​​(sílex, granito, andesito, sílex, basalto, peridotito ou obsidiana) e qualquer outra pedra. Enquanto segura a pedra quebrável, Sneak + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> no chão. Se estiver usando pederneira, você começará a desbastar imediatamente. Com outras pedras, você deve colocar uma pedra no chão primeiro e <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> nela com a pedra na mão.</li>\n<li>Depois de fazer isso, uma caixa de diálogo aparecerá, permitindo que você escolha qual cabeçote de ferramenta deseja fazer clicando nele.</li>\n<li>Depois de selecionar uma ferramenta, uma grau plana de voxels de 10x10 aparecerá no chão, alguns deles destacados com um contorno laranja. Enquanto segura outra pedra, corte os voxels mantendo pressionado ou clicando no seu próprio ritmo, até que nenhum voxel realçado permaneça. Você pode separar grupos de voxels desconectando-os da peça de trabalho principal. Considere sentar-se usando <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">G</kbd> para se aproximar da superfície de trabalho. Se você achar que a câmera livre distrai enquanto clica, você pode abrir qualquer caixa de diálogo (como o bate-papo) ou manter pressionado <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Alt</kbd> para desbloquear o mouse livre.</li>\n<li>Assim que terminar, você receberá seu cabeçote de ferramenta.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:KnapDiagBox.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/21/KnapDiagBox.png/250px-KnapDiagBox.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/2/21/KnapDiagBox.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"340\" data-file-height=\"217\" /></a><figcaption>Caixa de diálogo que permite selecionar um cabeçote de ferramenta.</figcaption></figure>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dica:</b>\n<pre>* The stone used to remove voxels doesn't need to be of the same or even a knappable material (e.g. sandstone, conglomerate, etc.).\n* Two players can work on knapping the same piece to complete a tool head faster. When the tool head is completed, it will jump into the inventory of the player who removes the last voxel.\n* You can open the inventory or press alt to move the mouse more freely.\n</pre>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n<span id=\"Finishing&#95;the&#95;Tool\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Finalizando_a_ferramenta\">Finalizando a ferramenta</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Stone_and_Bone_Tools.gif\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/34/Stone_and_Bone_Tools.gif/300px-Stone_and_Bone_Tools.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"431\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/3/34/Stone_and_Bone_Tools.gif 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"332\" data-file-height=\"477\" /></a><figcaption>Cabeça da ferramenta na grau.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Quando terminar e receber sua ferramenta, coloque-a na grade de artesanato em seu inventário (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">E</kbd>) com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/stick\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/stick\">graveto</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Stick\" title=\"Stick\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bone\">osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span> para receber sua ferramenta finalizada. Com a pederneira, os jogadores podem fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/axe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/axe\">machado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Axe\" title=\"Axe\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/hoe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/hoe\">enxada</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hoe\" title=\"Hoe\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/shovel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/shovel\">pá</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Shovel\" title=\"Shovel\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/spear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/spear\">lança</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Spear\" title=\"Spear\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/arrow\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/arrow\">pontas de flecha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Arrow\" title=\"Arrow\"> </a></span>. Com qualquer outra pedra, os jogadores podem fazer todas as ferramentas listadas acima, exceto pontas de flecha. Cabeças de ferramentas feitas de sílex ou obsidiana tendem a durar mais do que suas contrapartes feitas de andesito, basalto, sílex, granito ou peridotito; e ferramentas com cabo de osso tendem a ter 10 pontos de durabilidade extra\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n<span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Não se preocupe em cometer erros, o jogo evita que os jogadores quebrem as peças necessárias para moldar a ferramenta.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Versão\n</th>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #5E462A; color: #EAD3B3; border: 2px solid; border-color: #382b1e; text-align: center;\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.4.4\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">Knapping foi adicionado pela primeira vez\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2;\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.4.4.1\n</th>\n<td style=\"background-color: #E0CFBB; border-color: transparent;\">Os jogadores não podem mais bagunçar. O jogo impede que você remova os voxels necessários.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">Não é mais possível quebrar abaixo do bloco enquanto estiver com uma pederneira na mão.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.4.5\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #E0CFBB; border-color: transparent;\">Contornos de voxel Knapping mais finos.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.4.9.1\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">Receitas de desbaste agora também eliminam cabeçotes de ferramentas.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.10.9\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #E0CFBB; border-color: transparent;\">Removida a caixa de colisão das superfícies quebradas para ser menos irritante.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.12.3\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">As peças desconectadas de uma superfície de desbaste irão agora quebrar.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.18.0\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #E0CFBB; border-color: transparent;\">Todas as facas da Idade da Pedra agora produzem apenas 1 faca da receita de desbaste, e sua durabilidade foi duplicada.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #D1B296; text-align: center;\">v1.20.0\n</th>\n<td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #CCBCAB; border-color: transparent;\">Receitas de enxada de sílex/pedra feitas para corresponder melhor ao cabeçote da ferramenta real\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Video&#95;Tutorials\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Tutoriais_em_v.C3.ADdeo\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tutoriais_em_vídeo\">Tutoriais em vídeo</span></h2>\n<p>Obrigado ao SmileOnSpeedDial por criar e compartilhar com a comunidade VS!\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Como quebrar ferramentas de pedra\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"width: 400px; height:240px;\" class=\"ext-YouTube-video ext-YouTube-video--lazy\" data-ytid=\"uymFczlVtAE\"><img width=\"400\" height=\"240\" src=\"//img.youtube.com/vi/uymFczlVtAE/default.jpg\" /><!-- <iframe data-extension=\"youtube\" width=\"400\" height=\"240\" src=\"//www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/uymFczlVtAE?autoplay=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe> --></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%;